# Editors and OS. Anchored to the root: the corpus holds .vscode/ folders on purpose
# (an agent auto-approve setting, a removed-extension recommendation), and an unanchored
# rule kept them out of the repository, so CI scanned those samples with the evidence missing.
/.idea/
/.vscode/
.DS_Store

